# With completed hidden, a done INBOX is not the inbox: q adds to the first INBOX still shown.
file <<END
INBOX: @done(2026-10-01)
	- Old
INBOX:
	- Live
END
keys gc
hide @done
keys q
see Quick Add → INBOX
type To the shown inbox
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @done(2026-10-01)
	- Old
INBOX:
	- Live
	- To the shown inbox
END
